			"notes": "- Fixed ammo disappearing when it is returned to a Wireless Ammo Box (unloading a gun in TACZ 1.2.0+, or filling the box from an Ammo Storage block). Returned ammo is now inserted into the linked ME network; anything the network cannot accept is dropped at the player's position.\n- Fixed the Wireless Ammo Box removing ammo from the ME network when its power ran out.\n- Fixed a possible crash on clients connected to a dedicated server when the Wireless Ammo Box ran out of power."
		},
